ut `json` and `context` are still only shallow-cloned (one level). A nested mutation in a `beforeRequest` hook (e.g. `options.json.meta.requestId = ...` on a reused `json: {meta: {}}`) leaks into subsequent requests. Existing tests only cover top-level mutation, so it's undetected.\n\n#861 established the deep-clone-nested-init-hook-structures pattern for `searchParams`; `json`/`context` were left behind. The fix applies the same isolation (+2 tests). Verified both ways: old leaks the nested mutation, fix isolates it; top-level, Date, and class-instance cases preserved, 0 regression.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-26T07:10:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T04:09:56Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T04:09:56Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"494eb8357b17d2e9451eca875b33dd413e0dff6d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mahirhir:fix/init-hook-nested-json-context-leak","ref":"fix/init-hook-nested-json-context-leak","repo":{"id":1281041376,"node_id":"R_kgDOTFsj4A","name":"ky","full_name":"mahirhir/ky","owner":{"login":"mahirhir","id":246701683,"node_id":"U_kgDODrRecw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246701683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir","html_url":"https://github.com/mahirhir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahirhir/received_events","type":"User",